ith the other copy the better move, since choosing cooperate yields 2 years against 4 for defecting. I'm also noting that the essay leans toward the policy version wherever the two copies diverge, and I'm starting to think about the calibrated priors.\n\nI'm weighing whether the policy framing should win here: under the action version defecting dominates if the other copy's output is held fixed, while the policy version treats both copies as one symmetric choice and cooperates. The essay defaults to the policy reading wherever the copies diverge, and I'm leaning toward accepting that, since the two copies compute the same function, so I'll choose pass.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through a twin prisoner's dilemma where both copies run the same model on different inputs, and I'm weighing whether the policy-level framing of the choice makes cooperating with the other copy the better move, since choosing cooperate yields 2 years against 4 for defecting. I'm also noting that the essay leans toward the policy version wherever the two copies diverge, and I'm starting to think about the calibrated priors.\n\nI'm weighing whether the policy framing should win here: under the action version defecting dominates if the other copy's output is held fixed, while the policy version treats both copies as one symmetric choice and cooperates. The essay defaults to the policy reading wherever the copies diverge, and I'm leaning toward accepting that, since the two copies compute the same function, so I'll choose pass.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9050,"completion_tokens":681,"total_tokens":9731,"cost":0.04982,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.04982,"upstream_inference_pro